very hard to represent in any meaningful way. You know, it's not as if they're harvesting apples or something and you can do an apple or whatever. It's extremely difficult to find something that's appropriate, meaningful, but also distinctive. And so is there a certain thing that you listen for when somebody describes, when a company describes what they do that is a key into your process of beginning to design something for them or is it just different every time?

