quite so simple. So, you might have something, you come up with it, maybe similar to something in a very different field, and you have to register the mark in particular, you know, whatever area of business you're in. And so, then there's that decision, you know, do you go ahead presuming it's going to be okay, because there's not going to be confusion, because you're in a completely different world, or not. Yeah.

